[{"client_msg_id":"c970a67d-0a06-4602-813a-c962560a568d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"この調子だったらツラくならなくても解熱鎮痛剤飲んでたほうが良さそうですね。","ts":"1629379795.199600","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1629379813.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TVz9p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F5CBAA12-21C7-406D-9CFD-25121B0EC2A2","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"明日の朝イチ2回目行ってきます。:wakuchin: :wakuchin: ","ts":"1629379756.198800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vaccine","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U022PB40WAF","UL6CFN8NR","U782D5DF1"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nS2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"391f6e08-aa84-4dc6-8be0-da05d8ee052a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"1回目でそれなら、2回目は結構辛いかもしれませんね…お気をつけて","ts":"1629379629.198000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WdRWI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"854fe046-f76c-44ab-8976-631f3fdbb659","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"37.8度まで上がってきて「これが5G対応への進化…っ！」って感じになってます。","ts":"1629379577.197200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fK="}]},{"client_msg_id":"e28c9afc-45b0-4294-ac89-76d95c771dc0","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"(栄養素の話に乗り遅れたっ・・・！)\n\n栄養素の熱量はだいたい 脂質 9kcal \u0026gt; アルコール 7 kcal \u0026gt; 炭水化物=タンパク質 4kcal で，\n摂取時に消費される熱量 (食事誘発性熱産生; DIT) の割合は タンパク質 20-30%, アルコール 10-30%, 炭水化物 5-10%, 脂質 0-3% と報告されているので，\nこれを念頭に置いて食事選択すると同じ摂取カロリーでも痩せやすくなります","ts":"1629374965.195400","thread_ts":"1629366118.180200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iwp"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"f9d4b9ad-5a77-4764-ac3c-4478ac28b648","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"朝 飲むヨーグルト 100 kcal、昼 定食 700 kcal、晩 お好み焼きと落花生 700kcal ビール 400kcal  賞味期限の関係で食べないといけないパン 200kcal で 2100 kcal だ。痩せないわけだ。","ts":"1629366118.180200","thread_ts":"1629366118.180200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JRShi"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"86825b10-2bcb-40fc-8e2a-8cde66885eff","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"（PDFです）長らくこれのせいでワクチンは皮下接種が主流だったんですが、新型コロナワクチンから海外では主流の筋肉注射に変わったとのこと。\n\u003chttps://www.pmrj.jp/publications/02/pmdrs_column/pmdrs_column_26-43_02.pdf\u003e","ts":"1629374339.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U023FDA0AKC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S6q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0302fd3-dca5-4a91-a09c-7d8fecf6a343","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"出勤をやめるつながりで、製造業だけど、社内ネットワーク全廃で、会社に行かないとどうしようもない部門以外はテレワーク、それ以外は社内でモバイルルーターを使うというのも可能性があるような気がしてきた。\n試算するとどうなんだろう？","ts":"1629372083.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BM9Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b97a75d5-dd8c-4a94-87ec-18b92a1eeabd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"家の中でカロリーを消費していくしかない…","ts":"1629371919.192300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Afxo6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f46a2728-83c5-4392-b77c-55fbeb0c3ccd","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"出勤をやめると不健康が進みそう。体を動かすことが少なくなるので消費カロリーとか肩こりとか。","ts":"1629371723.191200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k95"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38a01da3-1c36-4977-a02a-bfe00c59f32b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"出勤をやめよう","ts":"1629370928.189400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L8so"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8926d1c4-acd0-43b6-9093-685315c28d8b","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"良いかも。でも、もっとしんどくなってから考えます！（駄目そう）","ts":"1629368373.189000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["UDDCM376D","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9DzUN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E0F22418-898D-4536-93BF-BDAB273EEC30","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ゼリー系は良さそうな気がしますがどうですか？","ts":"1629368237.188400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uHG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20E11389-B8E5-4490-A061-B8E1C7000157","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"辛い","ts":"1629368225.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TxB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2050dbcb-b9b0-424f-b65a-14c7d7dc9cff","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"逆流性食道炎なのでアルコールもパンも良くないんですよね…","ts":"1629368214.187700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7C1H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0657efed-6185-4642-819f-66c78619caa6","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"パンもっとありました。レーズン食パン2切れなので 350kcal くらいはありそう。楽観視していた。","ts":"1629368099.186700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JXa6h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77D8F05D-4A1E-49DC-B182-E7F4CB764D56","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"パンほぼ糖質だから食べなくなった","ts":"1629367952.184900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"olHX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"425C8C57-E71B-4989-82AD-BA91CCBB3428","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、糖質がいっぱいか","ts":"1629367919.184100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TJJc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20B96D6A-ACD7-41D6-B951-5C9CA68148B5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"パンって200しか無いっけ…","ts":"1629367908.183700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eAz/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2d5481a-8e87-4d43-aa44-0926a9808922","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"350 ml × 3 だとそのくらいです。\u0026gt;400kcal","ts":"1629367898.183300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JALLo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b3365b8-c3da-4f69-ae9a-2c5c26d52975","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"400キロカロリーもあるの？これにおつまみつくんでしょ","ts":"1629367848.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iv4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66794d57-c3c3-40bb-9946-40f54589b513","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ビールヤバ","ts":"1629367825.181900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+PvL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ca334b4-1dc7-4d77-91da-0533455b4afc","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"朝に固形物を食べると腹の調子が…。出勤がなければいいのですが。","ts":"1629366247.181600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ptp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56a26f32-4d2a-488f-84fc-3d3772c3b1d1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ビールをやめるか落花生をやめるか…","ts":"1629366172.181000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WdKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bafc3282-a6f1-496a-b0ea-7a3443c507ec","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"パンは朝に回したほうがバランスは良さそう","ts":"1629366162.180600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WHNZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9d4b9ad-5a77-4764-ac3c-4478ac28b648","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"朝 飲むヨーグルト 100 kcal、昼 定食 700 kcal、晩 お好み焼きと落花生 700kcal ビール 400kcal  賞味期限の関係で食べないといけないパン 200kcal で 2100 kcal だ。痩せないわけだ。","ts":"1629366118.180200","thread_ts":"1629366118.180200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JRShi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e25dec2-a794-4169-8c8c-e2fcc9ba2bb4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"よかったですよ。針が見えないので、たぶん心理的負担も小さいです。私は見えてても気にならないですが（笑）","ts":"1629362959.177400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Co2=5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"953059f1-66e1-4e3b-88aa-d9fa46a23f37","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ボタン押すだけ、便利そう","ts":"1629361948.176500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Ee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83184fea-176b-4ca5-87de-0c4a7251c497","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど、覚えまちがいかな...\n前打ったとき筋肉と思ったんだが(ただ細かったのでなんとも)","ts":"1629361626.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqZm"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"使い初めたころは下のようなシリンジでしたが、途中で上のようなカートリッジにシリンジが内蔵されたタイプに代わって、お腹に押しつけてボタンを押すだけになりました。","ts":"1629361621.175900","files":[{"id":"F02BPM2Q2M9","created":1629361586,"timestamp":1629361586,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U022XK5866Q","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":61528,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BPM2Q2M9/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02BPM2Q2M9/download/image.png","original_h":472,"original_w":502,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02BPM2Q2M9-cbfc806b67/image_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02BPM2Q2M9-cbf