l":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u5HCn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25fe5436-8550-4e09-9999-577f35e5d433","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ボケるの難しい、わかりみしかない","ts":"1629361193.172400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KYtwx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5633e0b7-f693-4d4d-8f78-d286b285e72c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.kenei-pharm.com/general/learn/influenza/6305/\u003e\nインフルエンザのワクチンは皮下注射っぽい。。？（静脈注射でもなかった）","ts":"1629361167.172000","attachments":[{"fallback":"健栄製薬: 【医師監修】インフルエンザの予防接種は筋肉注射？皮下注射？それぞれの違いも解説あり  | 健栄生活","id":1,"title":"【医師監修】インフルエンザの予防接種は筋肉注射？皮下注射？それぞれの違いも解説あり  | 健栄生活","title_link":"https://www.kenei-pharm.com/general/learn/influenza/6305/","text":"感染症にかからないように、予防接種を受けたことがある方も多いかと思います。日本では主に、筋肉注射と皮下注射が行われていますが、インフルエンザの予防接種はどちらなのでしょうか。この記事で詳しく解説します。","thumb_url":"https://www.kenei-pharm.com/general/cms/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/82-01.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"健栄製薬","service_icon":"https://www.kenei-pharm.com/favicon.ico","thumb_width":1304,"thumb_height":736,"from_url":"https://www.kenei-pharm.com/general/learn/influenza/6305/","original_url":"https://www.kenei-pharm.com/general/learn/influenza/6305/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGRZb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"244ee382-84d7-4bcf-ae7a-e87946127830","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"ボケるのって難しいなぁ…","ts":"1629361157.171700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Rt4Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fccd8934-fd7d-482e-a50d-2c4e646b1eb0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"筋肉に打つと、筋肉いぇいいぇーい！！ になるからです！\n\u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EWnl4YtUwAEpo05.jpg\u003e","ts":"1629360938.170800","attachments":[{"fallback":"787x589px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EWnl4YtUwAEpo05.jpg","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EWnl4YtUwAEpo05.jpg","original_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EWnl4YtUwAEpo05.jpg"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"drecz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D433CD28-181D-4DB7-9BFD-64B5F9FEBC8A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"作業効率化だと思ってた","ts":"1629360789.170200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3nvUW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"474bf3b9-c107-45e4-8000-dcda1334b937","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"インフルエンザワクチンは抗原そのものを打つんで抗原の量が決まるんだけども、mRNAは細胞に抗原(のスパイクだけを)作らせるものなので、体内でどのくらい作られるかは多少はバラつきそう。","ts":"1629360712.169800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sk1Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1650a89-9a46-4415-90a8-a61838f1eb03","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"聞いた話では筋肉に打つのがもっとも効果的に免疫系に働きかけられるから、ということです。","ts":"1629360572.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HFls"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12b233f9-565c-43bc-8036-67f7486a3393","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"mRNAワクチンが、というのもありますが、インフルエンザワクチンとかも筋注だったと思いますが...\n(今回のは挙動の問題で腕が重い、発熱が、というのはあります)","ts":"1629360173.166500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Kt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24e26f4c-4dae-4fea-ae76-c76088440f61","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"無知を晒すんですが、今回のワクチンってなぜ静脈注射ではなく筋肉注射なんでしょう？","ts":"1629359942.165300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J5BnQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4B051260-636F-4AB8-8537-22C6CDFA20FC","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"そらあなた、筋肉に直接異物ぶっ込んで何も無いとはならんでしょ…","ts":"1629359657.164700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"00UE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7e80b22-d368-4983-ad52-bfe4bd420a93","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"悟空が飲んだ苦しむけど強くなるあれみたいなw","ts":"1629358943.163200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xqI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68f89a87-1e6c-4c2d-b1fb-519eb01e21ae","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"耐えたらスーパーサイヤ人になれます。","ts":"1629358865.162700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JcM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e3bcae5-2b20-4a79-9cf6-2a0063cc4554","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"二回目はどうなってしまうのか","ts":"1629358549.162300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MIe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ee9d3ec-d8ad-4b84-bfa2-1f765b3160b3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"時間が経つにつれて苦しみが増えていく恐怖…。","ts":"1629358477.161900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wc0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2859259-0c19-4254-9263-6fb2f443c9dc","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"一回目でもきつそうですね","ts":"1629358409.161300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nRa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d49f9a51-181b-46ce-b7f4-a4b3d259d71d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ホント翌日がめちゃくちゃ怖い。","ts":"1629358075.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d=a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d529b3e4-0d87-4e0e-abd0-c5fb1e1a778e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"片腕が鉛でも入ったかのごとく重くなるから気をつけろという話はあちこちで聞いたのですが「そうはならんやろ」と斜に構えてたんですが、今ならこう言いたい。「なっとるやろがい！！」","ts":"1629358025.160500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jr2a4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0986b71d-5db2-4e35-b293-e78e6431e64a","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"2回目は発熱するらしいので３連休とった","ts":"1629357643.157900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p6=0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19de1e02-f02a-4e3d-a46f-86bf0f7eb476","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"自分も最近モデルナ打ったんですが翌日が一番腕動かしにくかったですね。筋肉痛みたいな。\n48時間後にはちょっと違和感あるかな？くらいになりました。","ts":"1629357587.157500","edited":{"user":"US90LD360","ts":"1629357622.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cTO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e1a0336-a648-4ea8-83bd-102e06b7625c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"片腕を封じられるだけでこんなにも戦闘力が落ちるとは…無念なり。","ts":"1629356959.155600","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1629356990.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":4,"users":["UR199T8TS","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2dj1B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8928221d-1469-43ed-968b-cef9efb2302d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"今日と翌日にUQ取っておいて正解でしたわ。これじゃ仕事にならん。","ts":"1629356551.154200","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1629356630.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ywe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13d578c7-ad3c-4307-8f7c-cca1531011b9","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"筋肉注射特有だと思いますけど、片腕が動かしにくい…なんか痺れる感覚。","ts":"1629356437.153500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0EK7J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"119fb7b1-772b-4ac6-bc50-cb77a282830a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://karapaia.com/archives/52305040.html\u003e","ts":"1629356316.152800","attachments":[{"fallback":"カラパイア: 年を取るにつれて代謝が落ちるは間違いだった。20歳から60歳までは安定しているという研究結果 : カラパイア","id":1,"title":"年を取るにつれて代謝が落ちるは間違いだった。20歳から60歳までは安定しているという研究結果 : カラパイア","title_link":"https://karapaia.com/archives/52305040.html","text":"　中年になってぽっこりと膨らんだお腹を見て、「いやー、もう歳だから。代謝が落ちちゃってさ〜」という言い訳はできなくなるかもしれない。　代謝は、生物体がエネルギーなどを外部から取り込み、体内で化学的に変化させ、不用なものを消費する反応のことだが、","image_url":"https://livedoor.blogimg.jp/karapaia_zaeega/imgs/a/c/ac97cd34.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"カラパイア","service_icon":"https://karapaia.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://karapaia.com/archives/52305040.html","original_url":"https://karapaia.com/archives/52305040.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","UR199T8TS"]},{"name":"chimeisyou","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"contribute-chance","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"binjoushitai","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w7fo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3796b8b0-086d-4c3b-916a-2b316acecc58","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"真面目に研究しててえらい \u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1428190713716428805?s=20|https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1428190713716428805?s=20\u003e","ts":"1629353185.152400","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release|@Science_Release\u003e: 「手洗い」は20秒以上かけて行うのは、流体力学的にも良い事がモデル計算によって分かったよ！手洗いの有効性に関する物理学的な視点での研究は初めてだよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nPaul S. Hammond. “Will we ever wash our hands of lubrication theory?” Physics of Fluids, 2021; 33 (8) 081908. \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9HxxaoVEAMTi6H.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"彩恵りり (科学系ニュース解説アカウント)","author_subname":"@Science_Release","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1428190713716428805","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1423908231282266114/UYmgV3IC_normal.jpg","text":"「手洗い」は20秒以上かけて行うのは、流体力学的にも良い事がモデル計算によって分かったよ！手洗いの有効性に関する物理学的な視点での研究は初めてだよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nPaul S. Hammond. “Will we ever wash our hands of lubrication theory?” Physics of Fluids, 2021; 33 (8) 081908. \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9HxxaoVEAMTi6H.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E9HxxaoVEAMTi6H.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1629342175,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1428190713716428805?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1428190713716428805?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tpVd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ceb62ae-26d9-4775-8d79-52b761357ac4","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"3時のおやつにプロテイン飲むとかしてみるかなぁ","ts":"1629351367.151700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YrQxR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da45ff7a-9d3f-4a16-accb-67e0c1be3ee0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"糖質と塩分に脂質を足したもの","ts":"1629351003.151100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RsGUf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e53a509d-0597-4c89-8bf3-fd6dcabe3bfb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"きつねうどん大好き","ts":"1629350993.150800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/TZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21548bf1-8ac7-489c-ae8b-edd09c461e49","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もちろん健康にはよくない :hai-small:","ts":"1629350099.150200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U72TB62UF","UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Isi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21f4ce9d-0b86-42a1-977a-ac7e729b4ed1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"貧民飯の類は大概カロリーの塊なので食事の質を落とすとカロリー「だけ」は余裕で超過してしまう","ts":"1629350063.149700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"d