":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m5gQP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d189f98b-31c2-4584-b6f5-a784fcab83c9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あ、いや、友人宅に行くのは一年以上だめだったのでそういう意味では個人の行動の自由を制限してるか","ts":"1629348322.132000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4vI0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5669c980-eecd-486b-906e-56cc233708f6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"飲食店へのライセンス提供を停止するみたいな形で運用されていた","ts":"1629348283.131300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PFJEY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"148b2fa4-07ed-40b3-a9f5-18caaa53112e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ちなみに二回目のときは個人の行動の自由を制限するタイプのものではなかったです","ts":"1629348272.130800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NssGa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d404a09a-a970-4877-abf3-a59520e067ba","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"３度目","ts":"1629348247.130100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yxi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce7f9b58-f771-4032-bf72-39258d4ab868","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"こっちはもうすぐまたlockdownしちゃいそうで怖い","ts":"1629348245.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NyG1S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a276c4d-34c9-4953-bffc-4f943ffea243","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"政治的な背景も何も、日本には犯罪者でもない個人の行動の自由を制限する手段・法律がないんですよ。それが不服なら緊急事態法の成立を目指している党や政治家を応援するしかない。","ts":"1629348204.129600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m9jp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"862f876a-14f4-4557-9180-09f8a0a3af81","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"今こそ自己防衛おじさんが出てくるときなんだろうけど。","ts":"1629348067.128000","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1629348086.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"32/1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e636af02-328c-4071-8e8b-19b4cb9e5ef7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"緊急事態宣言を外出の可否の定性的な根拠にしがちですけど、政治的背景とか絡みすぎてて、結局陽性者数とか、病床の逼迫度で各自判断しないといけない辛い状況だなと感じます。","ts":"1629348028.127100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfbd8df0-76da-44a7-b654-8febfb7bd51f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"今は9月12日になってる緊急事態宣言ですけど、9月末まで延長されるだろうという予想も立ってますし。","ts":"1629348001.126500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ymB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"078864aa-f418-462b-8928-971a41a9b0c2","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もちろんフル:vaccine:になっても感染症対策は継続して行っていきます。そもそも緊急事態宣言のせいで気晴らしに出かけられるようなところすらないんですけどね:sob:","ts":"1629347761.124500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1UjYf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cebc870-b61d-4883-87ad-5b43188408d2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁフルワクチンになっても行動が買えられるわけじゃないですが、2回目接種後一応2週間見たほうが良いですよ。","ts":"1629347532.122500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b79bd1d-caaf-4292-a739-696f4705939f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"9月前半に二回目の予約を入れられたので、それを接種して一週間経てば晴れて:5g: に。","ts":"1629347267.121800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XuG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c863c390-537b-49fc-9f68-2152583848f0","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":":vaccine:一回目 was Done","ts":"1629346606.120